Hitman Contracts – the next chapter in the story of a nameless killer with the strange name “Agent No. 47,” who dedicated his entire life to carrying out a wide variety of contracts for his superiors.

Agent 47 is a professional assassin who has long maintained a low profile, carrying out the most difficult contracts. But in this game, he's betrayed and now finds himself in a Paris hotel, surrounded by police, with a stomach wound. Before this unpleasant situation unfolds, Agent 47 decides to recall all of his contracts, which have become pivotal in his career. Several of the most memorable and dangerous missions will be available to you, subject to all conditions, from freedom of choice to freedom of action. But don't rush your adventures, as these contracts are far from simple; they are the most dangerous and unpredictable. Once Agent 47 understands the true purpose of his actions and realizes he's practically a hero, he'll gather his strength and try to escape this seemingly impossible situation.

