1424.description:
The arcade and indie games category continues to grow with interesting and engaging titles that are sometimes not only challenging but also magically beautiful. For example, we'd like to draw your attention to a game called Badland, which lets you take on the role of mythical creatures and embark on an unpredictable adventure through a dangerous world.

Badland has previously been released on consoles, but now it's time to dive into this adventure on PC. The developers have specially reworked the game, improved its graphics, added new levels, and optimized the game so players can enjoy this virtual fairy tale.
But Badland isn't just fun; it's also a dangerous world. Your task is to help fairytale creatures return home, but to do so, you'll need to overcome numerous challenges, traps, and even encounter dangerous creatures. The game's highlights include its extensive gameplay, which can last up to 15 hours, and the ability to play with friends.

Game features:
- an exciting platformer game with innovative technologies;
- realistic physics of character behavior and environment;
- 100 unique and beautiful levels;
- 27 universal levels, which are designed for cooperative play.

